# Product Discovery Rule

For significant features or programs, teams must produce a discovery package before full delivery execution.

Required discovery outputs:
- Problem statement with business impact and target users.
- Success metrics (north star + leading indicators + guardrails).
- User/job-to-be-done segmentation and priority rationale.
- Constraints map (budget, timeline, compliance, integration boundaries).
- Hypothesis list with measurable validation criteria.

Minimum quality bar:
- No vague goals ("better UX", "faster") without measurable targets.
- No roadmap commitment without explicit out-of-scope definition.
- No major build decision without at least one validated alternative.
